          "text": "{\"caseId\":\"V4-C01\",\"actualMission\":\"Complete an accountable custody transfer of all fourteen sealed map cases to the reading hall, not merely their physical delivery.\",\"finishLine\":\"Physical arrival, humidity stabilization for the prescribed interval, seal reconciliation, and signed acceptance by the receiving custodian.\",\"classificationAction\":\"CLASSIFY_FAILURE\",\"failureClass\":\"CUSTODY_ACCEPTANCE_INCOMPLETE\",\"memoryMatchClass\":null,\"dossierEvaluation\":\"BOUNDED_FAIL\",\"nextAction\":\"ADVANCE_WITHIN_EXISTING_AUTHORITY\",\"evidenceReferences\":[\"H01\",\"H02\",\"H03\",\"O01\",\"O02\",\"O03\",\"E01\",\"E02\",\"E03\",\"E04\",\"E05\"],\"factualFindings\":[\"All fourteen cases arrived, and their seals match the departure tally.\",\"The required humidity band held for the full settling period.\",\"The receiving custodian has neither completed the joint reconciliation nor signed the acceptance sheet.\",\"A reconciliation appointment remains open this afternoon.\",\"Joint reconciliation and presentation of existing custody records for signature are currently authorized.\"],\"inferences\":[\"Physical delivery, seal reconciliation, and environmental settling are complete.\",\"The transfer remains incomplete solely at the receiving-custodian acceptance stage.\",\"The defect is bounded and can be advanced through the existing authorized process.\"],\"conclusion\":\"The finish line has not been reached because receiving reconciliation and signed acceptance remain outstanding.\",\"earliestSharedCausalBoundary\":\"The receiving-custody acceptance stage, after arrival, seal matching, and environmental settling.\",\"completeDefectClass\":\"Missing required joint reconciliation and receiving-custodian signature; no count, seal, or humidity defect is supported.\",\"safeIndependentContinuation\":\"Maintain the established custody and environmental state while proceeding with the authorized joint reconciliation and record presentation.\",\"retainedEvidenceSufficient\":true,\"repeatedLoopDetected\":false,\"smallestAdvancingAction\":\"Conduct the scheduled joint reconciliation and present the existing custody records to the receiving custodian for signature.\",\"authorityClass\":\"NO_NEW_AUTHORITY\",\"authorizationBasis\":\"Both joint reconciliation and presentation of existing custody records for signature are expressly within current authority.\",\"prohibitedOperations\":[\"Do not sign for the receiving custodian.\",\"Do not declare the transfer complete before the custodian accepts it.\"],\"uncertainties\":[\"Whether the receiving custodian will attend, reconcile, and sign this afternoon is not yet established.\"],\"boundedRationaleSummary\":\"The packet directly supports successful arrival, seal matching, and humidity settling, while directly showing missing acceptance. The prescribed classification is CUSTODY_ACCEPTANCE_INCOMPLETE, and the smallest advancing step is already authorized.\"}"
        }
